<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id36" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FedSQ</span>:
<br class="ltx_break">Optimized Weight Averaging via Fixed Gating
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id37" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:113.9pt;">

<span id="id37.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="id37.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id37.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Cristian Pérez-Corral*</span></span>
<span id="id37.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id37.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="id37.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Universitat Politècnica de València</span></span></span>
<span id="id37.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id37.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Valencia, Spain</span></span>
<span id="id37.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id37.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">cpercor@upv.es</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="id38" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:113.9pt;">

<span id="id38.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
